OL,4,B'You don't win 345 matches by          
OL,5,Bdefending' - Simeone breaks La Liga    
OL,6,Brecord                                 
OL,7,GAtletico Madrid's 3-0 victory over     
OL,8,GGetafe may have been routine, but the  
OL,9,Gwin was another landmark in manager    
OL,10,GDiego Simeone's lengthy tenure at the  
OL,11,Gclub.                                  
OL,13,FSunday's triumph at Estadio Coliseum   
OL,14,Fwas the Argentine's 345th La Liga win  
OL,15,Fin his 567th match, surpassing the     
OL,16,Frecord for the most victories in the   
OL,17,FSpanish top flight.                    
